;===========================================================
; Abstract Reordered fight screen: Under Night In-Birth x Melty Blood AACC mix (4:3, generated by build_ar_hud.py)
; Everything sits at the top. Corner portraits for AR characters are drawn by cadenza.lua; others show their 9000,0 face.
; fonts 1-8, fightfx, common.snd, fx1/fx2 and snd stay the VPFG ones: the VPFG modules in save/config.ini use them.
;===========================================================
